      "id": "claim_52e4d365262547008897c9d537ad8b74",
      "statement": "The plugin registers exactly one Portable Text block type, code-block-pro, whose editor form is built by createBlockType with nine fields: code (multiline text_input), language (select, initial javascript), theme (select, initial options.defaultTheme or github-dark), filename (text_input), lineNumbers (toggle, initial false), startingLineNumber (text_input), lineHighlights (text_input), copyButton (toggle, initial true), and maxHeight (text_input).",
